# Claude Code local settings. Never publish: this file holds a permission
# allowlist, and allowlist entries have carried a plaintext GH_TOKEN. It is also
# reachable over HTTP once deployed, because .nojekyll disables the Jekyll pass
# that would otherwise drop dotfiles from the Pages artifact.
.claude/

